# Paths OpenGrep / Semgrep must NOT scan.
# These are third-party inputs and generated outputs — not the solution's own code —
# so scanning them would report findings for code we did not write.

# Organizer-provided starter pack (immutable third-party submissions)
starter-pack/

# Generated workspaces, including combined-solution/ copies of submission code
workspace/

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/

# CI configuration (not application code)
.github/
